  "L1: Real long-horizon agent+RAG traces with human-annotated in-context-presence labels (not constructed generator)",
  "L1: Head-to-head comparison vs semantic query cache (GPTCache/RAGCache) at matched skip-rate — evaluation_prosecutor's point is unrebutted: random-skip is a sanity check, not a deployment-relevant baseline",
  "L1: Real sentence embedding replacing stdlib hashed surrogate, with measured AUC gap closure vs lexical Jaccard",
  "L1: End-to-end task accuracy with a real LLM in the loop (model may recover from wrong skips via re-ask, or fail despite correct retrieval)",
  "L1: Live ≥2-source prior-art sweep for conversational/history-aware retrieval gating on in-context residency — novelty_killer was permission-blocked and could NOT complete this; the gap is structural, not optional",
