  "Semantic query cache (GPTCache-style): cache past (query, result) pairs, skip on embedding-similarity hit — the operationally relevant comparator the L0 entirely omits (evaluation_prosecutor, unrebutted)",
  "Always-retrieve (already present as acc=1.000 baseline — adequate)",
  "Oracle skip (already present as AUC=1.0 upper bound — adequate)",
